              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kamwana Samueli kamũthũkũmĩaa Yeova vu mbee wa Eli. Na ndeto ya Yeova yaĩ vata mũno mĩthenya ĩsu; kũtyaĩ woni kaingĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
