            "sid": "1SA 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova ooka, na aũngama, na eetana ta metana ala angĩ, Samueli, Samueli. Nĩvo ĩndĩ Samueli waisye, Neena; nũndũ mũthũkũmi waku nũkwĩw’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
