            "sid": "1SA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova amwĩa Samueli, Sisya, ngeeka ũndũ nthĩnĩ wa Isilaeli, ũla matũ elĩ ma kĩla mũndũ ũla wĩĩw’a makasĩĩlĩla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
